# i18n: generated. zh.json/ko.json are committed, but the per-key source (file:line) index
# is excluded: it is large and line numbers shift on every source edit, making diffs churn.
# It can be regenerated any time with `npm run extract:i18n` (used for B2 wiring and B3 translation).
/messages/zh.sources.json
